1. Open Opportunity
2. Open Vendor Quote Agent tab
3. Upload/select vendor quote
4. Ask agent to process quote
5. Agent reads file
6. Agent extracts quote content
7. Agent maps content into standard payload
8. Agent matches products where possible
9. HTML displays mapped lines
10. User edits line items
11. User saves edits
12. User approves each line
13. User gives final approval
14. Agent creates staging audit snapshot
15. Agent creates Opportunity Product Lines
16. Agent links created lines back to staging
17. User sees final result
